---
permalink: /placement/reading/
layout: layouts/runner.njk
title: Reading placement test
description: A short spoken test that finds where in the reading program a child should begin.
exitUrl: /lessons/
---
<div class="runner-start" id="placement-start" hidden>
  <article class="finish">
    <p class="eyebrow">Placement test</p>
    <h1 class="finish__title">Where should we begin?</h1>
    <p class="finish__lead">The placement test is a set of short sections, each covering a stretch of lessons. It begins by checking that the child can say a sound after you and say a word fast from its parts; then the sections go on until one is not passed, and the test names the lesson to start with. Most children finish in ten to twenty minutes.</p>
    <p class="finish__lead">Read each line aloud, let the child answer, and mark Firm or Error. Do not correct or help. Hold the dot under the letters as you would in a lesson.</p>
    <div class="btn-row btn-row--stack">
      {% for sec in program.placements.reading %}{% if sec.readiness or (sec.from == 1 and sec.level != "reading-1") %}
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--block" data-start="{{ loop.index0 }}">Start with {{ sec.levelName }}{% if sec.level == "reading-1" %} (a child new to reading){% else %} (a child who has read Reading 1 or a hundred lessons like it){% endif %}</button>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="finish__links"><li><a href="/lessons/">Back to the lessons</a></li></ul>
  </article>
</div>
<script id="runner-data" type="application/json">{"mode":"placement","subject":"reading","exitUrl":"/lessons/","sections":{{ program.placements.reading | dump | safe }},"afterAll":{"level":"done","lesson":0,"url":"/lessons/","label":"reading past this program (every section was passed)"}}</script>
